        "spoilage",
        "seasonality",
        "monsoon",
        "pre-coagulation"
      ],
      "summary": "Pre-coagulation is the largest spoilage cause in every season. Its share of total spoilage is about 71% in June-August versus about 47% in December-February. Aggregates only; no estate or worker records.",
